.TH AERIE 1 "2026-09-23" "aerie 0.4.0" "Aerie User Commands"
.SH NAME
aerie \ \- cyber-focused network diagnostic suite (CF-NDS)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aerie-launcher.sh
.RI "[ --start | --stop | --status | --auto | --browser | --web | --integ | --disinteg | --help ]"
.br
.B just
.RI "<recipe>  [recipe-args...]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Aerie
is a zero-telemetry, high-assurance alternative to commercial speedtests:
LibreSpeed (bandwidth), Hyperglass (BGP path visibility), SmokePing (jitter
persistence), fronted by a Zig gateway that wraps every response in a proof
envelope and routes every request through a policy gate. The gateway serves
GraphQL and REST on port 4000 and a length-prefixed gRPC protocol on port
4001.
.PP
The
.B aerie-launcher.sh
entry point is a standards-compliant, launch-scaffolder-generated
cross-platform launcher (process runtime: keep-open lifecycle, desktop-tools
resolution ladder, idempotent desktop integration).
.SH LAUNCHER OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-start
Start the gateway process (default when no mode flag is given).
.TP
.B \-\-stop
Stop the running process.
.TP
.B \-\-status
Show running status (PID, uptime, log tail).
.TP
.B \-\-auto
Alias for
.B \-\-start
(auto-attach behaviour).
.TP
.B \-\-browser , \-\-web
Open the SOC HUD front-end in the browser.
.TP
.B \-\-integ
Install the desktop entry, shortcut and icon (idempotent).
Pass
.B \-\-force
to reinstall over an existing integration.
.TP
.B \-\-disinteg
Remove everything
.B \-\-integ
installed (idempotent).
.TP
.B \-\-help , \-\-h
Print usage and exit.
.SH JUSTFILE RECIPES
The Justfile is the single entry point for builds and checks.
High-arity reference (run
.B just \-\-list
in-tree for the live set):
.TP
.B setup
First-time setup:
.B doctor
then
.B heal
(installs just if missing, platform detection).
.TP
.B build , build-release
Compile the Zig gateway (debug / ReleaseSafe).
.TP
.B test
In-tree suites: zig unit tests
(BR zig build test),
the Idris2 proven-tests suite
(BR tests/idris2),
the tracked-drift Rust crate tests, and the submodule suites.
.TP
.B tests
Alias of the original submodule-delegating test recipe (kept).
.TP
.B bench
Run the benchmark stubs (full benchmark suite: ROADMAP Phase 7).
.TP
.B lint
shellcheck + typos across the repo.
.TP
.B format
shfmt (shell) and zig fmt (FFI) where available.
.TP
.B clean
Remove regenerable build artefacts (zig-out, .zig-cache, rust target/).
.TP
.B security
gitleaks + trivy file-system scan (degrades gracefully when absent).
.TP
.B audit
Dependency audit (cargo audit for the tracked-drift crate).
.TP
.B assail
panic-attack pre-commit scan (when the tool is installed).
.TP
.B quality
lint + tests.
.TP
.B doctor , heal
Toolchain health check / automatic repair.
.TP
.B release , install
Stage / install the release binary and the man page
(BR PREFIX overridable, default /usr/local).
.TP
.B guix-shell
Enter the Guix toolchain environment from guix.scm.
.TP
.B container-build
Build the two-stage OCI image (root Containerfile, Podman).
.TP
.B specs , specs-check , specs-hooks , specs-unlock , specs-verify
K9 spec pipeline: regenerate the guarded manifest, verify it, install the
guarding pre-commit hook, or unlock outputs for regeneration.
.TP
.B man , cookbook
Locate the man page / generate docs/just-cookbook.adoc.
.TP
.B crg-grade , crg-badge
Print the CRG grade / render its badge (source of truth: READINESS.adoc).
.TP
.B tour , help-me
Guided project tour / common-workflow help.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LIBRESPEED_URL , HYPERGLASS_URL , SMOKEPING_URL
Backend probe endpoints for the gateway clients.
.TP
.B REDIS_URL
Cache + audit trail store.
.TP
.B AERIE_API_KEY
Policy-gate key (per-key rate limiting).
.TP
.B AERIE_HTTP_PORT , AERIE_GRPC_PORT
Gateway ports (default 4000 / 4001).
